## Node 2: relay — forwards bundles 1,2,4 to Node 3, abandons bundle 3
## (no route to Node 4). cbraggr 3 3 10 aggregates up to 3 forwarding
## events; when bundle 4 (seqNum+3) is forwarded, the CRS entry covers
## seqNums [+0, +1, gap, +3] and must encode a range array.
1
a scheme ipn 'ipnfw' 'ipnadminep'
a endpoint ipn:2.0 x
a endpoint ipn:2.1 x
a protocol udp 1400 100
a induct udp 127.0.0.1:4582 udpcli
a outduct udp 127.0.0.1:4581 udpclo
a outduct udp 127.0.0.1:4583 udpclo
r 'ipnadmin node.ipnrc'
m custodymode orangebook
m srmode compressed
m cbraggr 3 3 10
s
